OL,5,G2200 Coroner
OL,6,     FJenny hosts Thanksgiving at home
OL,7,     Fwith her dad and mother-in-law.
OL,8,     FBut when the plumbing breaks down,
OL,9,     Fher work life and personal life
OL,10,     Fcollide in the worst possible way.
OL,11,G2300 Walker
OL,12,     FWalker and Captain James
OL,13,     Finvestigate a high-stakes poker
OL,14,     Fgame where one of the players may
OL,15,     Fhave information on Emily's
OL,16,     Fkiller. The night takes a turn
OL,17,     Fwhen Geri joins the game.
